OL,3,GNEWSATrees felled as police probe
OL,4,A'signs of poisoning'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo mature trees have been felled after
OL,7,Fpolice say there were signs they may
OL,8,Fhave been poisoned.
OL,10,FLincolnshire County Council said the
OL,11,Flime and hornbeam trees, on Chaucer
OL,12,FDrive, Lincoln, had to be chopped down
OL,13,Fon Wednesday because they were dying
OL,14,Fand could have posed a danger.
OL,16,FChris Miller, head of environment at
OL,17,Fthe authority, said the trees, which
OL,18,Fwere 50 to 60 years old, had been
OL,19,F"killed off" and there were "clear
OL,20,Fsigns of some definite interference".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
