OL,3,GNEWSATrees felled as police probe
OL,4,A'signs of poisoning'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLincolnshire Police said there were
OL,7,Findications that at least one of the
OL,8,Ftrees "had been poisoned by a
OL,9,Fherbicide", but there was "insufficient
OL,10,Fevidence" to prove who had done it and
OL,11,Fthe case had been closed.
